  "sink_finder.php has no definition for `DB::unprepared`/`DB::insert`/`DB::update`/`DB::delete` (STATIC_SINKS at tools/php-audit-skills/tools/sink_finder.php:196-206); the raw-SQL execution at app/Http/Controllers/Home/HomeController.php:204 is therefore reported only as an LFI read.",
