  "Dynamic invocation detection flags any `$var(...)` as RCE (sink_finder.php:284-287), producing middleware `$next()` false positives.",
  "No `unserialize`, `extract`, `eval`, `assert`, `system`/`exec`/`shell_exec`/`passthru`/`proc_open`/`popen`, `whereRaw`/`orderByRaw`/`selectRaw`, `simplexml_load_*`, or `move_uploaded_file` occurrences exist under app/ (grep cross-check, 2026-10-24): zero Deserialization sinks in scope.",
